{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "This is the story of the lost balloon.",
      "audio": "voice/n1.wav",
      "durationMs": 2183,
      "loudnessDb": -20.1,
      "peakDb": -6.5
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Tofu had a red balloon. It was the best balloon in the whole garden.",
      "audio": "voice/n2.wav",
      "durationMs": 4295,
      "loudnessDb": -19.9,
      "peakDb": -3.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "speaker": "pim",
      "text": "Tofu! Tofu! Look what I can do!",
      "audio": "voice/p1.wav",
      "durationMs": 3396,
      "loudnessDb": -16.8,
      "peakDb": -3
    },
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "speaker": "tofu",
      "text": "Wow, Pim! How did you do that?",
      "audio": "voice/t1.wav",
      "durationMs": 2919,
      "loudnessDb": -19.6,
      "peakDb": -5.6
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "And just like that, the balloon was gone.",
      "audio": "voice/n3.wav",
      "durationMs": 2706,
      "loudnessDb": -18.7,
      "peakDb": -3.8
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "speaker": "bobo",
      "text": "Why the long ears, Tofu?",
      "audio": "voice/b1.wav",
      "durationMs": 1868,
      "loudnessDb": -13.5,
      "peakDb": -2
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "speaker": "tofu",
      "text": "I let go of my balloon. Now it's up in the sky.",
      "audio": "voice/t2.wav",
      "durationMs": 4138,
      "loudnessDb": -18.9,
      "peakDb": -6.8
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "speaker": "bobo",
      "text": "Then it can see the whole world from up there.",
      "audio": "voice/b2.wav",
      "durationMs": 1855,
      "loudnessDb": -14.8,
      "peakDb": -4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "speaker": "tofu",
      "text": "The whole world? Lucky balloon.",
      "audio": "voice/t3.wav",
      "durationMs": 2533,
      "loudnessDb": -19.6,
      "peakDb": -3
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "And Tofu decided that was a very good place for a balloon to be.",
      "audio": "voice/n4.wav",
      "durationMs": 4493,
      "loudnessDb": -18.6,
      "peakDb": -4.3
    }
  ]
}
